{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WELCOME TO HELL</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Devilish, unfair, and damn funny \u2013 that's Hell Games!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fallen Olympians, former tricksters, and doping offenders are now battling it out in the deepest pits of hell. Here, 1-4 players engage in an infernal player vs player competition. Grab weapons and upgrades to take down your opponents - and always watch out for the lava. May the most ruthless prevail! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BEAT \u2018EM UP</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off against friends or bots in your own realm, or jump into online mode to go head-to-head with fellow Steam players! The main thing is, make sure you end up with that well-deserved victory crown in your hands!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >STAY UNFAIR </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In hell, doping isn't just allowed, it's mandatory! With a whopping 8 different power-ups, you'll be boosted to an unbeatable force. Stronger, bigger, faster - maybe even invisible. Grab them quickly before your opponents get a chance!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FIGHT LIKE AN ATHLETE </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Athletes aren't allowed to carry knives? No problem! In hell, sports equipment gets a whole new purpose. With a discus, spear, or hammer, you'll knock your competition out of the ring. There are a total of 8 different sports tools waiting for you to masterfully wield!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CRAFT YOUR CHAMPION </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Define you athlete's physique and style, then dive into the arena. Command with precision using mouse and keyboard, or wield a gaming controller for ultimate control. Not feeling the setup? Remix it to match your vision.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2554970/extras/2642226762b1a4267b4ff83c08f124c0.avif?t=1765536366\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2554970/extras_big/2642226762b1a4267b4ff83c08f124c0.webp?t=1765536366 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2554970?t=1765536366","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2554970/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1765536366","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2554970/87a245f4c5e0280ca7f43b5fc0a8bc23aa807a66/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765536366","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2554970/87a245f4c5e0280ca7f43b5fc0a8bc23aa807a66/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1765536366","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3242960,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WELCOME TO HELL</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Devilish, unfair, and damn funny \u2013 that's Hell Games!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fallen Olympians, former tricksters, and doping offenders are now battling it out in the deepest pits of hell. Here, 1-4 players engage in an infernal player vs player competition. Grab weapons and upgrades to take down your opponents - and always watch out for the lava. May the most ruthless prevail! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BEAT \u2018EM UP</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off against friends or bots in your own realm, or jump into online mode to go head-to-head with fellow Steam players! The main thing is, make sure you end up with that well-deserved victory crown in your hands!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >STAY UNFAIR </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In hell, doping isn't just allowed, it's mandatory! With a whopping 8 different power-ups, you'll be boosted to an unbeatable force. Stronger, bigger, faster - maybe even invisible. Grab them quickly before your opponents get a chance!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FIGHT LIKE AN ATHLETE </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Athletes aren't allowed to carry knives? No problem! In hell, sports equipment gets a whole new purpose. With a discus, spear, or hammer, you'll knock your competition out of the ring. There are a total of 8 different sports tools waiting for you to masterfully wield!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CRAFT YOUR CHAMPION </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Define you athlete's physique and style, then dive into the arena. Command with precision using mouse and keyboard, or wield a gaming controller for ultimate control. Not feeling the setup? Remix it to match your vision.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2554970/extras/2642226762b1a4267b4ff83c08f124c0.avif?t=1765536366\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2554970/extras_big/2642226762b1a4267b4ff83c08f124c0.webp?t=1765536366 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p>","developers":["Voodoo Circus"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Sports","id":"18"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2554970/header.jpg?t=1765536366","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<